This package is a clean-room high-level implementation of documented Famicom
Disk System BIOS behaviour. It contains no Nintendo firmware, BIOS image, ROM,
key, or disassembly.

Documentation sources:
  https://www.nesdev.org/wiki/FDS_BIOS
  https://www.nesdev.org/wiki/FDS_file_format
  https://www.nesdev.org/wiki/FDS_disk_format

NESdev wiki text is used as a specification reference only. No wiki text is
copied into this package. Famicom, Famicom Disk System and Nintendo are
trademarks of Nintendo; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Nintendo.

The package is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. It is a library
for emulator cores, not a complete emulator, and it makes no compatibility
claim for any commercial title.
